{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into your street sweeper and master the satisfying art of cleaning, from fallen leaves to forgotten treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get behind the wheel of your trusty sweeper and keep the neighborhoods tidy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax and unwind in the atmospheric world of Sweep City.<br>Demo contains 1 map to cruise through and sweep</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying driving and street cleaning mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover hidden treasures as you sweep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn collected materials and rare finds into sweeper upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cruise to your own tunes with the built-in media player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493070?t=1748583586","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493070?t=1748583586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493070/77b90ff25df14217bb53ae17219096b606d374ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748583586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493070/77b90ff25df14217bb53ae17219096b606d374ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748583586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into your street sweeper and master the satisfying art of cleaning, from fallen leaves to forgotten treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get behind the wheel of your trusty sweeper and keep the neighborhoods tidy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax and unwind in the atmospheric world of Sweep City.<br>Demo contains 1 map to c